airBaltic Club – an innovative loyalty programme designed for every traveller. 
Download the app, join airBaltic Club, and start enjoying the loyalty benefits!

Main app features:

• Get exclusive offers and discounts;
• Book flight tickets and check in for flights;
• Manage your booking and enhance your trip with additional services;
• Use digital card or add it to your Wallet to collect points;
• Check your airBaltic Club point balance and transactions;
• Spend airBaltic Club points on rewards;
• Receive instant prizes at the Shake&Win game.

More information at airBaltic.com/club

